# Solemnity's "Counters can't be put on ... enchantments" (CR 122.6, 101.2): Song of Freyalise, a Saga, enters with no lore counter
# (CR 714.3a, the ruling) and gets none as Bot1's next precombat main phase begins (CR 714.3c), so no chapter ability triggers
# (CR 714.2b) and, with no lore counters, it is never sacrificed (CR 714.4): it sits on the battlefield, and Bot1's Ornithopter
# never gets chapter III's counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Sol Ring
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Solemnity
Song of Freyalise
Ornithopter
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Solemnity.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Song of Freyalise.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Stack.Count = 0
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Song of Freyalise.Counters.Lore = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
